    {
      "id": "b34ba316-cd37-42e6-bd87-54e1e680c3e4",
      "name": "Control API Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## FlowAgent • Website control\nSet FLOWAGENT_WEBSITE_API_TOKEN privately in Render. Create Header Auth credential: Authorization = Bearer <same token>. Select it on both HTTP nodes.\n\nEdit resource and patch in Website Configuration. Run with dryRun=true to inspect the current content; no write occurs. Set dryRun=false to apply your reviewed patch.\n\nPATCH preserves omitted fields. 412 means another edit happened: inspect the latest content before retrying. No automatic retries. This template does not delete records. No admin login or secrets in this export.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 680
      }
    }
